  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "scene_IJJ7OTRJVh",
      "type": "slide",
      "order": 1,
      "title": "Course Introduction",
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "action_Iw3uskM-",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_9E2PGd3N"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_umAHIEhj",
          "text": "Hello everyone, and welcome to our Introduction to CSS course! I'm thrilled to have you here as we begin this journey into web styling.",
          "type": "speech"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_au8N7wau",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_a7mLMgdl"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_BJVGRP93",
          "text": "First, let's talk about what CSS is and why it matters. CSS, or Cascading Style Sheets, is the language that lets us make web pages look beautiful and organized, turning plain HTML into engaging experiences.",
          "type": "speech"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_ra6L3-ov",
          "type": "laser",
          "elementId": "text_a7mLMgdl"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_Hv8zUPSa",
          "text": "Next, you'll see the key learning outcomes for this course: you'll learn how to style text, layout pages, create responsive designs, and build confidence to bring your own creative ideas to life.",
          "type": "speech"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_16hlsdVE",
          "type": "laser",
          "elementId": "text_a7mLMgdl"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_OZjWoZK7",
          "text": "Finally, here's how the lessons are structured. We'll start with the fundamentals, then move on to selectors, the box model, positioning, and finish with a hands‑on project that ties everything together.",
          "type": "speech"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_cjzM9Sro",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_a7mLMgdl"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_NvF0FZZk",
          "text": "I'm excited to explore CSS with you—let's dive in and start shaping the web!",
          "type": "speech"
        }
      ],
